<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Batembuzi</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Tembuzi</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Batembuzi are the first, legendary dynasty of the kingdom of Kitara in the traditions of Bunyoro and its neighbours. Remembered as gods or semi-divine rulers associated with the creation of the world and the origins of kingship, they are said to have been followed by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chwezi">Chwezi</a> and then by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/babiito-dynasty">Babito</a>. Historians treat these traditions as myth rather than as a record of real reigns.</p></div>
